WHY THIS IS CC0
---------------
Emotes are made to be used: uploaded to a Discord server, a Slack
workspace, a Twitch channel, a sticker sheet, a product. None of those
places has room for a credit line, and a set nobody may put to work is not
a set. So there are no conditions: use them, change them, sell what you
make with them, with no attribution and no licence file.

The rest of IconFlow's published artwork (the gallery, the archive, the
showcase) stays under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; this directory is the deliberate
exception. The IconFlow name and mark are NOT covered by this dedication.
See ../TRADEMARKS.md and ../LICENSES.md.
